---
import Badge from "../Badge.astro";
import { Check, ShieldCheck, Zap, Clock } from "lucide-astro";

const requirements = [
  { text: "DNI vigente", desc: "Persona natural o representante legal." },
  { text: "Contacto directo", desc: "Correo electrónico o WhatsApp." },
  { text: "Fecha de inicio", desc: "Día exacto en que inicia la actividad." },
  { text: "Detalle de actividad", desc: "Puesto específico (soldador, etc.)" }
];

const deliverables = [
  "Certificado digital oficial (PDF)",
  "Aprobación inmediata para ingresos",
  "Respaldo total ante SUNAFIL"
];
---

<section class="bg-[#0B0B0B] py-32 overflow-hidden relative">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#80808008_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#80808008_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-size-[40px_40px] mask-[radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)]"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      
      <div class="flex flex-col space-y-10">
        <div>
          <Badge text="Proceso de Gestión" variant="primary" size="sm" className="mb-6" />
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-6">
            Solo necesitas <br /> 
            <span class="text-[#B61F1F] drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(182,31,31,0.3)] animate-pulse-slow">
                cuatro datos.
            </span>
            </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
            Eliminamos la fricción burocrática con un flujo diseñado para contratistas que no pueden permitirse perder un día de obra.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          {requirements.map((req) => (
            <div class="group flex gap-5 p-4 rounded-2xl transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-white/3 border border-transparent hover:border-white/5">
              <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/20 flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-500 group-hover:bg-green-500 group-hover:text-black">
                <Check class="text-green-500 group-hover:text-black w-5 h-5 transition-colors" strokeWidth={3} />
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-lg">{req.text}</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">{req.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative w-full">
        <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-72 h-72 bg-[#B61F1F]/5 blur-[100px] rounded-full"></div>
        
        <div class="relative bg-linear-to-br from-[#121212] to-[#080808] border border-white/10 rounded-[40px] p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm flex flex-col h-full">
          
          <div class="flex items-center gap-5 mb-10">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#B61F1F] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(182,31,31,0.3)]">
              <ShieldCheck size={32} />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Garantía de Entrega</h3>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#B61F1F] font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mt-1">
                <Zap size={12} fill="currentColor" />
                <span>Gestión de respuesta rápida</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-[#B61F1F] pl-6 italic mb-10">
            "Tu certificado SCTR llega digitalizado a tu correo y WhatsApp en tiempo récord, listo para ingresar a obra hoy mismo".
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-3 mb-10">
            {deliverables.map((item) => (
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/2 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20">
                <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(34,197,94,0.6)]"></div>
                <span class="text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium">{item}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="mt-auto pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between">
             <span class="text-[10px] text-white/20 font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Aliza Seguros</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  h2, h3 {
    font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  p, span, h4 {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
</style>